"
=========================
Brake Pressure Over Limit
=========================
Applies 95 against the brake limit of 80.

.. warning::

   Fails on purpose: 95 is over the brake limit, so the last step fails
   and VMCBRA00007 rolls up Red. Use it to see a failing step.

Requirements
------------
1. :req:`VMCBRA00007`
"

(Precondition "Demo running in normal mode"
  (demo-in-mode? :normal)
  :heal (start-demo :normal))

"
Steps
-----
"

(set-reading :brake-pressure 95)
(brake-pressure-ok? (reading :brake-pressure))
